'''Weightlifter Cat '''is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.3 Update|Version 7.3]] increases its attack power, health, range and knockbacks. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]].

